        <p>Every build starts with a conversation. We listen, we design, we craft — and we don't hand over the keys until it's exactly right. <!-- VERIFY: Confirm founding story details and workshop location with the client --></p>
        <p>From compact home saunas to full wellness retreats, we work directly with homeowners across Ireland. No middlemen. No shortcuts.</p>

